{"page":284,"verses":[{"verse_key":"17:18","surah":17,"ayah":18,"ar_uthmani":"مَّن كَانَ يُرِيدُ ٱلْعَاجِلَةَ عَجَّلْنَا لَهُۥ فِيهَا مَا نَشَآءُ لِمَن نُّرِيدُ ثُمَّ جَعَلْنَا لَهُۥ جَهَنَّمَ يَصْلَىٰهَا مَذْمُومًا مَّدْحُورًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If anyone desires [only] the fleeting life, We speed up whatever We will in it, for whoever We wish; in the end We have prepared Hell for him in which to burn, disgraced and rejected.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَّن","en_gloss":"Whoever","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"17:18"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"should","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"17:18"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُرِيدُ","en_gloss":"desire","transliteration":"yurīdu","verse_key":"17:18"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْعَاجِلَةَ","en_gloss":"the immediate","transliteration":"l-ʿājilata","verse_key":"17:18"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَجَّلْنَا","en_gloss":"We hasten","transliteration":"ʿajjalnā","verse_key":"17:18"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"17:18"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"17:18"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"17:18"},{"pos":9,"ar":"نَشَآءُ","en_gloss":"We will","transliteration":"nashāu","verse_key":"17:18"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لِمَن","en_gloss":"to whom","transliteration":"liman","verse_key":"17:18"},{"pos":11,"ar":"نُّرِيدُ","en_gloss":"We intend","transliteration":"nurīdu","verse_key":"17:18"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"17:18"},{"pos":13,"ar":"جَعَلْنَا","en_gloss":"We have made","transliteration":"jaʿalnā","verse_key":"17:18"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"17:18"},{"pos":15,"ar":"جَهَنَّمَ","en_gloss":"Hell","transliteration":"jahannama","verse_key":"17:18"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يَصْلَىٰهَا","en_gloss":"he will burn","transliteration":"yaṣlāhā","verse_key":"17:18"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مَذْمُومًۭا","en_gloss":"disgraced","transliteration":"madhmūman","verse_key":"17:18"},{"pos":18,"ar":"مَّدْحُورًۭا","en_gloss":"rejected","transliteration":"madḥūran","verse_key":"17:18"},{"pos":19,"ar":"١٨","en_gloss":"(18)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:18"}]},{"verse_key":"17:19","surah":17,"ayah":19,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَنْ أَرَادَ ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةَ وَسَعَىٰ لَهَا سَعْيَهَا وَهُوَ مُؤْمِنٌ فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ كَانَ سَعْيُهُم مَّشْكُورًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But if anyone desires the life to come and strives after it as he should, as a true believer, his striving will be thanked.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَنْ","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"17:19"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرَادَ","en_gloss":"desires","transliteration":"arāda","verse_key":"17:19"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةَ","en_gloss":"the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhirata","verse_key":"17:19"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَسَعَىٰ","en_gloss":"and exerts","transliteration":"wasaʿā","verse_key":"17:19"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَهَا","en_gloss":"for it","transliteration":"lahā","verse_key":"17:19"},{"pos":6,"ar":"سَعْيَهَا","en_gloss":"the effort","transliteration":"saʿyahā","verse_key":"17:19"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"while he","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"17:19"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مُؤْمِنٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a believer","transliteration":"mu'minun","verse_key":"17:19"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"then those","transliteration":"fa-ulāika","verse_key":"17:19"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"[are]","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"17:19"},{"pos":11,"ar":"سَعْيُهُم","en_gloss":"their effort","transliteration":"saʿyuhum","verse_key":"17:19"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَّشْكُورًۭا","en_gloss":"(is) appreciated","transliteration":"mashkūran","verse_key":"17:19"},{"pos":13,"ar":"١٩","en_gloss":"(19)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:19"}]},{"verse_key":"17:20","surah":17,"ayah":20,"ar_uthmani":"كُلًّا نُّمِدُّ هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ وَهَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ مِنْ عَطَآءِ رَبِّكَ ۚ وَمَا كَانَ عَطَآءُ رَبِّكَ مَحْظُورًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"To both the latter and the former, We give some of your Lord’s bounty. [Prophet], your Lord’s bounty is not restricted-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"كُلًّۭا","en_gloss":"(To) each","transliteration":"kullan","verse_key":"17:20"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نُّمِدُّ","en_gloss":"We extend","transliteration":"numiddu","verse_key":"17:20"},{"pos":3,"ar":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","en_gloss":"(to) these","transliteration":"hāulāi","verse_key":"17:20"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَهَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","en_gloss":"and (to) these","transliteration":"wahāulāi","verse_key":"17:20"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"17:20"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَطَآءِ","en_gloss":"(the) gift","transliteration":"ʿaṭāi","verse_key":"17:20"},{"pos":7,"ar":"رَبِّكَ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of) your Lord","transliteration":"rabbika","verse_key":"17:20"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"17:20"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"is","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"17:20"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَطَآءُ","en_gloss":"(the) gift","transliteration":"ʿaṭāu","verse_key":"17:20"},{"pos":11,"ar":"رَبِّكَ","en_gloss":"(of) your Lord","transliteration":"rabbika","verse_key":"17:20"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَحْظُورًا","en_gloss":"restricted","transliteration":"maḥẓūran","verse_key":"17:20"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٢٠","en_gloss":"(20)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:20"}]},{"verse_key":"17:21","surah":17,"ayah":21,"ar_uthmani":"ٱنظُرْ كَيْفَ فَضَّلْنَا بَعْضَهُمْ عَلَىٰ بَعْضٍ ۚ وَلَلْـَٔاخِرَةُ أَكْبَرُ دَرَجَـٰتٍ وَأَكْبَرُ تَفْضِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"see how We have given some more than others- but the Hereafter holds greater ranks and greater favours.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱنظُرْ","en_gloss":"See","transliteration":"unẓur","verse_key":"17:21"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَيْفَ","en_gloss":"how","transliteration":"kayfa","verse_key":"17:21"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَضَّلْنَا","en_gloss":"We preferred","transliteration":"faḍḍalnā","verse_key":"17:21"},{"p