7:22"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٢٢","en_gloss":"(22)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:22"}]},{"verse_key":"17:23","surah":17,"ayah":23,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَقَضَىٰ رَبُّكَ أَلَّا تَعْبُدُوٓا۟ إِلَّآ إِيَّاهُ وَبِٱلْوَٰلِدَيْنِ إِحْسَـٰنًا ۚ إِمَّا يَبْلُغَنَّ عِندَكَ ٱلْكِبَرَ أَحَدُهُمَآ أَوْ كِلَاهُمَا فَلَا تَقُل لَّهُمَآ أُفٍّ وَلَا تَنْهَرْهُمَا وَقُل لَّهُمَا قَوْلًا كَرِيمًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Your Lord has commanded that you should worship none but Him, and that you be kind to your parents. If either or both of them reach old age with you, say no word that shows impatience with them, and do not be harsh with them, but speak to them respectfully","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَقَضَىٰ","en_gloss":"And has decreed","transliteration":"waqaḍā","verse_key":"17:23"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَبُّكَ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbuka","verse_key":"17:23"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَلَّا","en_gloss":"that (do) not","transliteration":"allā","verse_key":"17:23"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَعْبُدُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"worship","transliteration":"taʿbudū","verse_key":"17:23"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَّآ","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"17:23"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِيَّاهُ","en_gloss":"Him Alone","transliteration":"iyyāhu","verse_key":"17:23"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَبِٱلْوَٰلِدَيْنِ","en_gloss":"and to the parents","transliteration":"wabil-wālidayni","verse_key":"17:23"},{"pos":8,"ar":"إِحْسَـٰنًا ۚ","en_gloss":"(be) good","transliteration":"iḥ'sānan","verse_key":"17:23"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِمَّا","en_gloss":"Whether","transliteration":"immā","verse_key":"17:23"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَبْلُغَنَّ","en_gloss":"reach","transliteration":"yablughanna","verse_key":"17:23"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عِندَكَ","en_gloss":"with you","transliteration":"ʿindaka","verse_key":"17:23"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْكِبَرَ","en_gloss":"the old age","transliteration":"l-kibara","verse_key":"17:23"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَحَدُهُمَآ","en_gloss":"one of them","transliteration":"aḥaduhumā","verse_key":"17:23"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَوْ